# Providers: switch backends and models
Output providers.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 18
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Width 1200
Set Height 800

Type "cd sample-project && nvim init.lua"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type ":DwightBackend"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type ":DwightBackend codex"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type ":DwightProviders"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type ":DwightSwitch opus"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Sleep 3s
